# Office art consistency

When generating, editing, reviewing, or integrating art or animation for the
office game, read the canonical guidance before working:

- `docs/office/art-direction.md`
- `docs/office/asset-pipeline.md`
- `docs/office/art-prompts.md`

Open the actual images in `office/art-source/style-reference.json`, respecting
each reference's scope. Use the work order and review process in those docs.
Keep this adapter thin; update the canonical documents for process changes.
